<view class="page"><view class="title">我的订单</view><view class="subtitle">只显示当前顾客提交的订单。匿名模式的历史保留在本设备会话中。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="refresh">刷新</button><view class="card" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text>#{{item.number}} · {{item.store_name}}</text><text>{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="line" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="dish" wx:key="name">{{dish.name}} × {{dish.qty}}</view><view class="line">备注：{{item.note||'无'}}</view><view class="price">¥{{item.displayTotal}}</view><button class="primary" wx:if="{{item.payment==='unpaid'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pay">模拟支付</button><view wx:else>已支付（Demo）</view></view><view class="card" wx:if="{{!orders.length}}">还没有订单，去喜欢的小店点一份吧。</view></view>
